    {
      "id": "2xh6k2h",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "5.5 Special Economic Zones (SEZs) and Industrial Corridors"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The Visakhapatnam-Chennai Industrial Corridor (VCIC) is a major industrial development initiative connecting the two cities. Andhra Pradesh also has several SEZs in Visakhapatnam and Krishnapatnam focusing on IT, pharmaceuticals, and manufacturing. The PCPIR (Petroleum, Chemicals and Petrochemicals Investment Region) at Visakhapatnam/Kakinada is another major initiative.",
      "id": "wrd0li2"
    }
  ],
  "enriched": false
}